{"$comment":"Traceability: run_events table (data-model.md) and contract-map rows 'host-issued cursors / bounded replay / at-least-once' and 'honest offline' (control-core-unification.md §4). This is verb 1 of 4: append run events. event_id is worker-generated and stable across retries, making append idempotent: the service stores by event_id and reports duplicates in service.events.stored. The worker never sets actor or server time; the service derives both.","$defs":{"event":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"dedupe_key":{"description":"Optional milestone dedupe key, e.g. '<run_id>:restored'. Preserves the PoC recordEvent() per-kind dedupe across the seam.","maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"event_id":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$","type":"string"},"event_type":{"enum":["run.started","run.restored","run.thinking","run.answer_delta","run.activity_changed","run.saving","run.artifacts_delivered","run.completed","run.failed","run.cancelled","run.interrupted","run.terminated","provider_session.bound","approval.requested","approval.dispatched","approval.settled","approval.request_timed_out","run.resumed"],"type":"string"},"payload":{"description":"Type-specific payload; exact shape is selected by event_type via oneOf.","oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.started"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"turn_config_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["turn_config_digest"],"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.restored"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bytes":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"file_count":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["file_count","bytes"],"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.thinking"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{},"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.answer_delta"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"batch_seq":{"description":"Worker-side monotonic batch counter; lets the service order deltas from a retrying worker.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"text":{"description":"Bounded streamed text batch. Persisted before the replay cursor advances (data-model, streaming rule).","maxLength":4096,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["text","batch_seq"],"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.activity_changed"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"activity":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["activity"],"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.saving"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{},"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.artifacts_delivered"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bytes":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"file_count":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"manifest_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["manifest_digest","file_count","bytes"],"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.completed"},"payload":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"answer_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"artifact_manifest_digest":{"pattern":"^[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["answer_digest"],"type":"object"}},"required":["event_type","payload"]},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_type":{"const":"run.failed"},"payload":{"addit